.TH VEX 1
.SH NAME
vex \- Wave package manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vex
[-q|--quiet] [-v|--verbose] [--message-file <new-path>] [--manifest-path <vex.ws>] [-p|--package <name>|--workspace] [--features <features>] [--no-default-features] [--include-tests] <command> [options]
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B vex init [\-\-lib]
Manage init
.TP
.B vex build [\-\-lib] [\-\-bin <name>] [\-\-target <triple>] [\-\-profile <name>|\-\-release] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline]
Compile selected package targets
.TP
.B vex run [\-\-bin <name>] [\-\-target <triple>] [\-\-profile <name>|\-\-release] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline] [\-\- <args...>]
Compile and execute one binary
.TP
.B vex check [\-\-lib] [\-\-bin <name>] [\-\-target <triple>] [\-\-profile <name>|\-\-release] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline]
Check selected package targets
.TP
.B vex test [filter] [\-\-target <triple>] [\-\-profile <name>|\-\-release] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline] [\-\- <args...>]
Compile and execute explicit main-based tests; run every selected test and return the first failure
.TP
.B vex fetch [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline] [\-\-target <triple>]
Manage fetch
.TP
.B vex update [<package>...] [\-\-target <triple>]
Manage update
.TP
.B vex info
Manage info
.TP
.B vex metadata [\-\-format=json] [\-\-format\-version <1|2>] [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline] [\-\-target <triple>]
Manage metadata
.TP
.B vex tree [\-\-invert <name>] [\-\-depth <n>] [\-\-locked] [\-\-offline] [\-\-target <triple>]
Manage tree
.TP
.B vex clean [\-\-dry\-run]
Manage clean
.TP
.B vex prune [\-\-apply] [\-\-dry\-run]
Manage prune
.TP
.B vex doctor [\-\-format=json] [\-\-target <triple>]
Manage doctor
.TP
.B vex setup wavec [\-\-version <version>] [\-\-script\-fallback]
Manage setup
.TP
.B vex new <path> [\-\-name <name>] [\-\-lib] [\-\-git]
Create a new project without overwriting data
.TP
.B vex add <name> (\-\-git <url>|\-\-path <path>) [\-\-branch <ref>|\-\-tag <ref>|\-\-rev <rev>] [\-\-version <version>] [\-\-version\-req <requirement>] [\-\-package\-name <name>] [\-\-subdir <path>] [\-\-offline]
Add a direct dependency preserving comments and formatting
.TP
.B vex remove <name> [\-\-offline]
Remove a direct dependency preserving comments and formatting
.TP
.B vex cache prune [\-\-apply] [\-\-dry\-run]
Explicitly prune shared Git objects
.TP
.B vex completions <bash|zsh|fish|powershell>
Print shell completion script
.TP
.B vex manpage
Print the vex(1) manual
.SH FILES
vex.ws, vex.lock
.SH ENVIRONMENT
VEX_WAVEC, VEX_CACHE_HOME
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 1 internal error; 2 usage; 3 resolution; 4 compiler; 5 environment; 124 timeout; 130 cancellation. Program exit codes are preserved.
